   "order of extremes from M1: day's high printed before its low -> bearish read; low first -> bullish; same M1 -> skip",
   "trade the read at the next session open; stop = that day's extreme against the read; target = its opposite extreme; max hold 23h trading bars; controls on the daily grid"
  ],
